{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116922","id":3340536428,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7HHIps","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116922","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116922.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116922.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116922","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116922/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116922/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116922/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3a073b13c22d738a9af400f0e96f91b2002f8da6","number":116922,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add sampler functions to `HeightMapShape3D`","user":{"login":"Quantx","id":2834674,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MzQ2NzQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2834674?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx","html_url":"https://github.com/Quantx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Quantx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14363 by implementing sampler functions for `HeightMapShape3D` that return the height at a given position without invoking `PhysicsServer3D`. This has been tested extensively and accurately mirrors how the physics engine (both Jolt and GodotPhysics3D) compute heightmap collisions, including NaN holes.\r\n\r\nThis project [heightmap-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25659546/heightmap-test.zip) provides a basic test environment to validate my changes. Ensure that you open it using this PR's build and that `Debug > Visible Collision Shapes` is enabled. A random heightmap of size 25x25 with a NaN hole in the middle will be generated each time the project is run. The camera can be moved with WASD and rotated by holding right click while dragging the mouse. A green sphere is drawn based on a raycast emitted from the center of the camera. While a blue sphere is drawn based on the sampled heightmap height at the same position. The margin between Y position of the two spheres is displayed in the top left (closer to zero is better).","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","nu